            },
            {
              "name": "text.body",
              "value": "=Ready to start {{$json.name}}? Here's what you get:\n\u2705 Professional storefront\n\u2705 Secure payments\n\u2705 Order management\n\u2705 Buyer discovery\n\nSetup is free & takes 15 min: https://eki.app/signup\n\nReply HELP if you need assistance."
